DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:Missouri: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Form MO-1120 due 15th day of 4th month after year end\; Missour
 i automatically extends to match the federal extension\, but the .gov sourc
 e does not give a single fixed Missouri date (it ties to whatever the feder
 al extension is). Payment still due on the original date. | Form MO-1120 du
 e 15th day of 4th month after year end\; Missouri automatically extends to 
 match the federal extension\, but the .gov source does not give a single fi
 xed Missouri date (it ties to whatever the federal extension is). Payment s
 till due on the original date. | Authority: Direct fetch of Missouri's own 
 tax agency site/publication this session | Source: https://dor.mo.gov/forms
 /MO-1120%20Instructions_2025.pdf | This date is computed from a recurrence 
 rule and may not reflect a later-announced change\; confirm against the cit
 ed source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
